  References
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prometheus, “Alerting rules”: &lt;a href="https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/configuration/alerting_rules/" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/configuration/alerting_rules/&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prometheus, “Alertmanager”: &lt;a href="https://prometheus.io/docs/alerting/latest/alertmanager/" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://prometheus.io/docs/alerting/latest/alertmanager/&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Datadog, “Monitors”: &lt;a href="https://docs.datadoghq.com/monitors/" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://docs.datadoghq.com/monitors/&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sentry, “Alerts”: &lt;a href="https://docs.sentry.io/product/alerts/" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://docs.sentry.io/product/alerts/&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
